##Business Plan 1##
MBP0A1 Marson: You look like someone who can handle business. Came to the right place.
MBP0A2 Maybe. What's the job?
MBP0A3 Marson: Some punks have been stealing my packages. I need them taken care of and my stuff brought back. Do it right and you'll get paid.
MBP0A4 Alright. Where do I find them?
MBP0A5 Marson: They won't be hard to spot. Just don't waste time.
MBP0A6 Fine. I'll handle it.

MBP0A7 Marson: Not bad. You handled that real smooth.
MBP0A8 Told you I could get it done.
MBP0A9 Marson: Yeah, I see that. You earned this. I'll make sure you get paid.
MBP0A10 Good. Got anything else lined up?
MBP0A11 Marson: Maybe. Come find me again if you're looking for more work.
MBP0A12 I'll be around.

##Business Plan 2##
MBP1A1 Kamil: Hey, good timing. I got something that needs handling. You interested?
MBP1A2 What kind of job?
MBP1A3 Kamil: Someone's been interfering with my business. Taking things that don't belong to them. I want it stopped and my property returned. You do that, you get paid.
MBP1A4 Sounds simple enough. I'll take care of it.
MBP1A5 Kamil: Don't underestimate it. Just finish the job and don't make a mess of it.
MBP1A6 I'll get it done.

MBP1A7 Kamil: Hm. Better than I expected.
MBP1A8 I don't disappoint.
MBP1A9 Kamil: Clearly. Your payment's taken care of.
MBP1A10 Good. I'm open to more work.
MBP1A11 Kamil: We'll see. Come back if you're still looking.
MBP1A12 I will.

##Business Plan 3##
MBP2A1 Sean: You're here. Good. I don't like waiting around. You looking for work or what?
MBP2A2 Depends. What's in it?
MBP2A3 Sean: Some idiots have been messing with my business, taking things they shouldn't. I want them dealt with and everything returned. You handle it, you get your cut.
MBP2A4 Fine. I'll take care of it.
MBP2A5 Sean: Don't drag it out. I want this finished quick and clean.
MBP2A6 Yeah, I got it.

MBP2A7 Sean: Hah, looks like you actually pulled it off.
MBP2A8 Told you I would.
MBP2A9 Sean: Not bad. Money's yours, like I said.
MBP2A10 Got anything else, or was that it?
MBP2A11 Sean: Maybe later. Come back when I've got something worth your time.
MBP2A12 I'll check in.

##Business Plan 4##
MBP3A1 Kely: There you are. I was hoping you'd show up. Looking for work?
MBP3A2 Maybe. What do you need?
MBP3A3 Kely: Someone's been interfering with something that belongs to me. I want it handled and everything returned. Do that, and you'll be rewarded.
MBP3A4 Alright. I'll deal with it.
MBP3A5 Kely: See that you do. I don't like loose ends.
MBP3A6 It'll be done.

MBP3A7 Kely: Impressive. You handled that better than most would.
MBP3A8 I know what I'm doing.
MBP3A9 Kely: Clearly. Your payment is taken care of.
MBP3A10 If you've got more work, I'm interested.
MBP3A11 Kely: Perhaps. Come back and we'll talk again.
MBP3A12 I'll keep that in mind.

##Business Plan 5##
MBP4A1 Charlie: Hey. You showed up. Good. You looking to make some money?
MBP4A2 Maybe. What's the situation?
MBP4A3 Charlie: Got people sticking their hands where they don't belong, taking things that aren't theirs. I need that handled and everything brought back. You do that, you get paid.
MBP4A4 Alright. I'll sort it out.
MBP4A5 Charlie: Try not to turn it into a circus. Just get it done.

MBP4A7 Charlie: Huh. That went smoother than I expected.
MBP4A8 Told you I'd handle it.
MBP4A9 Charlie: And you did. Money's yours.
MBP4A10 Got anything else going on?
MBP4A11 Charlie: Maybe later. Swing by again and we'll see.
MBP4A12 Sure.

##Business Plan 6##
MBP4A1 Kenji: You made it. Good. If you're here, I assume you're ready to work.
MBP4A2 What needs to be done?
MBP4A3 Kenji: There are people interfering with my operations, taking what belongs to me. I want them removed and everything returned. Complete this, and you will be paid.
MBP4A4 Understood. I'll handle it.
MBP4A5 Kenji: Do it properly. No mistakes.
MBP4A6 It'll be done.

MBP4A7 Kenji: Efficient. I expected nothing less.
MBP4A8 Job's finished.
MBP4A9 Kenji: You've earned your payment.
MBP4A10 If there's more, I'm available.
MBP4A11 Kenji: Return when you're ready for another task.
MBP4A12 I will.

#Business Plan Objective#
MBPHT1 Go to the ~y~target location ~w~and locate the enemies using a nearby vehicle
MBPHT2 Eliminate ~r~all enemies ~w~in the area within the time limit
MBPHT3 Take the ~g~briefcase ~w~and get into a ~b~car
MBPHT4 Drive to the ~y~alliance meeting location ~w~with the ~b~car

