##Protect Trucking 1##
PTK0A1 Fared: Hey Carl! i'm glad you came to this place today, do you need a job?
PTK0A2 Carl: Yes Sir, what kind of job do you have available?
PTK0A3 Fared: Yes i have task for you, Enemy forces are chasing and try to destroy Alliance Truck and i need you to passed that, eliminate all enemies and follow ally truck until it reaches me
PTK0A4 Carl: Okay, and where is the enemy's location? i'm going to take action and suprise them and protect Alliance Truck safe for you sir
PTK0A5 Fared: Follow the Radar target location and you'll find where the enemy appears, you have limited time to completed the mission and don't get lost by mistake, if you succeed will be a reward, good luck Carl!
PTK0A6 Carl: Okay sir, i'll do it, thanks...

PTK0A7 Fared: Amazing, you're awesome, Carl! doing you skill with action protect Alliance Truck into here are really cool!
PTK0A8 Carl: Yes, and that what i can do with that job, Sir!
PTK0A9 Fared: You have my respect luck was on your side, i'll give you a reward sending it to your wallet bank
PTK0A10 Carl: Yes, I'd like to take on more challenges to hone my skills, Sir...
PTK0A11 Fared: Alright, I'm going back in my base. If you want job, come back to my base again. Goodbye, Carl!
PTK0A12 Carl: Yes, goodbye Sir. I'll see you soon!

