##Protect Trucking 1##
PTK0A1 Fared: Good, you made it. You looking for work?
PTK0A2 What's the job?
PTK0A3 Fared: An alliance truck is under attack. Enemy vehicles are trying to take it out, and I need you to keep them off it until the truck reaches me.
PTK0A4 Alright. I'll hit the attackers and keep the truck safe.
PTK0A5 Fared: Stay close, keep it moving, and don't let that truck go down. You do that, you get paid.
PTK0A6 I'll handle it.

PTK0A7 Fared: Nice work. You kept that truck rolling all the way through.
PTK0A8 That job was never getting away from me.
PTK0A9 Fared: Good to hear. Your reward's being sent to your account.
PTK0A10 Fine by me. I can take more work anytime.
PTK0A11 Fared: Then come back if you want another run.
PTK0A12 I will.

##Protect Trucking 2##
PTK1A1 Rudy: Hey, perfect timing. You here for a contract?
PTK1A2 Depends on the contract.
PTK1A3 Rudy: We've got an alliance truck on the move, and enemy forces are all over it. I need you to wipe them out and make sure the truck gets through safely.
PTK1A4 Sounds good. I'll protect the truck and clear the road.
PTK1A5 Rudy: Don't fall behind and don't let them break through. Finish it, and there's money waiting.
PTK1A6 Got it.

PTK1A7 Rudy: Smooth work. You kept the truck safe the whole way.
PTK1A8 I said I'd get it done.
PTK1A9 Rudy: And you did. Your payment's on the way.
PTK1A10 Good. Let me know when the next one hits.
PTK1A11 Rudy: Come back when you want another job.
PTK1A12 I'll be around.

##Protect Trucking 3##
PTK2A1 John: You showed up. Good. You ready to work?
PTK2A2 Tell me what needs doing.
PTK2A3 John: Enemy forces are chasing one of our trucks. I need you to clear them out and keep that truck alive until it reaches me.
PTK2A4 Alright. I'll cover the truck and deal with anyone in its way.
PTK2A5 John: Good. Stay on it and don't let the pressure get to you.
PTK2A6 Fine. I'm moving.

PTK2A7 John: That was solid. The truck made it through because of you.
PTK2A8 Just another job done right.
PTK2A9 John: Then here's your reward. I'll send it over now.
PTK2A10 Good. I'm up for more if it pays.
PTK2A11 John: Then come find me again.
PTK2A12 I will.

##Protect Trucking 4##
PTK3A1 John: Back again, huh? You after work?
PTK3A2 Maybe. What's going on?
PTK3A3 John: Another alliance truck needs protection. Enemy drivers are trying to smash it before it gets through. I need you to stop them.
PTK3A4 Alright. I'll keep the truck moving and shut them down.
PTK3A5 John: Good. Keep your head clear and don't let the truck get boxed in.
PTK3A6 Understood.

PTK3A7 John: Nice. You kept that run alive.
PTK3A8 That's what happens when I'm on the job.
PTK3A9 John: Fair point. Your money's coming through now.
PTK3A10 Good. Send more work my way when it shows up.
PTK3A11 John: Come back if you want another job.
PTK3A12 I'll check in.

